      "solution": "$\\log(2^t \\times 5^t) = \\log((2 \\times 5)^t) = \\log(10^t) = t$",
      "ai_explanation": {
        "concept_rule": "Index power distribution rule $a^t b^t = (ab)^t$.",
        "step_by_step": [
          "Combine $2^t \\times 5^t$ into $(2 \\times 5)^t = 10^t$.",
          "Apply $\\log_{10}(10^t) = t$."
